@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = cambia-este-token
@movementId = 1

### Salud
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Registrar movimiento de pago
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment-movements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: test-payment-create-001

{
  "casa": 42,
  "monto": 900.00,
  "observaciones": "Pago correspondiente a julio",
  "formaPago": 1,
  "fechaPago": "2026-07-07",
  "mes": 7,
  "anio": 2026
}

### Registrar el mismo pago para varias casas
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment-movements/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: test-payment-batch-001

{
  "casas": [1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 9, 16, 19],
  "monto": 800.00,
  "observaciones": "Pago correspondiente a agosto",
  "formaPago": 1,
  "fechaPago": "2026-08-04",
  "mes": 8,
  "anio": 2026
}

### Consultar movimiento
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payment-movements/{{movementId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Generar y enviar recibo por movimiento (200 OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment-movements/{{movementId}}/send-receipt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-ID: test-receipt-send-001

### Generar todos los recibos del mes sin enviar WhatsApp
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/receipts/generate-monthly
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: test-monthly-receipts-001

{
  "mes": 8,
  "anio": 2026
}

### Compatibilidad: enviar por casa y mes del año actual
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/receipts/send
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "casa": 42,
  "mes": 7
}
